AXION FABRIC V.24.4: THE DEFINITIVE ARCHITECTURAL SPECIFICATION FOR HARDENED HETEROGENEOUS MATRIX COMPUTING AND DISTRIBUTED RDMA FABRIC\
Document ID: AF-24.4.0-SPEC-ULTIMATE-HARDENED-XL\
Revision: 2024.Q4.C\
Classification: Technical Deep-Dive / Mission-Critical HPC Specification\
Status: Final Specification - Thermal Watchdogs, Affinity Guards, and RDMA Scaling Integrated\
